{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"Wondershare.DemoCreator","latestVersion":"8.8.7","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"An easy-to-use screen recorder for lessons and tutorials.","license":"Proprietary","licenseUrl":"https://www.wondershare.com/company/end-user-license-agreement.html","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"An easy-to-use screen recorder for lessons and tutorials.","license":"Proprietary","licenseUrl":"https://www.wondershare.com/company/end-user-license-agreement.html","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Wondershare DemoCreator is a professional presentation video creation tool that integrates recording and editing to help you create videos more efficiently. Using DemoCreator, you can not only experience high-definition screen recording, webcam capture, microphone voice-over recording, screen drawing tool, spotlight, and other practical recording functions. You can also use the built-in video templates, transition effects, green screen chroma key, Pan&Zoom, stickers, and other hundreds of editing tools and presentation video templates to help you create videos with ease.\nDemoCreator has made special optimizations for video creation such as presentations, online training, and game recording. It supports the audio and video sub-track editing of the recorded files according to the input source. It uses cursor effects, audio fade-in and fade-out, and other post-production tools to accurately modify the video material so that you can make better use of the video material. During game recording, unique adaptations and optimizations have been made for various popular games to stabilize the image capture and enhance the game recording experience.","name":"Wondershare DemoCreator","packageUrl":"https://democreator.wondershare.com/","publisher":"Wondershare Software","publisherUrl":"https://www.wondershare.com/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://democreator.wondershare.com/whats-new.html","tags":["ar","capture","class","clip","conference","course","creative","creativity","edit","editor","marketing","meeting","presentation","record","tutorial","video"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"一个用于课程与教程的易于使用的屏幕记录器","license":"专有软件","licenseUrl":"https://www.wondershare.com/company/end-user-license-agreement.html","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Wondershare DemoCreator 一款集录制和编辑于一体的专业演示视频创作工具，帮助您更效率地创作视频。您可以体验到高清录屏、相机画面捕获、麦克风画外音录制、录屏涂鸦、聚光灯演示等实用的录制功能；可使用软件内置的场景模板、转场特效、绿幕抠像、Pan&Zoom、蒙版贴纸等上百款编辑工具与演示视频模板，助您在创作视频时得心应手。此外，DemoCreator 即将上线云端在线素材商城，支持搜索和下载最新最热的视频模板、声音素材及专业的特效资源，让您更自由地捕捉灵感，发挥创意。\nDemoCreator 对演示解说、在线培训、游戏录制等内容创作做了特别的优化，在编辑器内不仅支持对录制的视频内容根据输入源进行音视频分轨后期剪辑，还能使用光标特效、音频淡入淡出等后期工具，对视频素材进行进精确修饰，便于您更好地利用视频素材。在游戏录制时，针对多款热门游戏进行了特别的适配和优化，稳定采集画面，提升录制体验。","name":"Wondershare DemoCreator","packageUrl":"https://democreator.wondershare.com/","publisher":"Wondershare Software","publisherUrl":"https://www.wondershare.com/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://democreator.wondershare.com/whats-new.html","tags":["ar","会议","创意","剪辑","录制","录屏","录课","微课","抠像","教程","演示","视频","编辑","编辑器","营销","课程"]}},"longDescription":"Wondershare DemoCreator is a professional presentation video creation tool that integrates recording and editing to help you create videos more efficiently. Using DemoCreator, you can not only experience high-definition screen recording, webcam capture, microphone voice-over recording, screen drawing tool, spotlight, and other practical recording functions. You can also use the built-in video templates, transition effects, green screen chroma key, Pan&Zoom, stickers, and other hundreds of editing tools and presentation video templates to help you create videos with ease.\nDemoCreator has made special optimizations for video creation such as presentations, online training, and game recording. It supports the audio and video sub-track editing of the recorded files according to the input source. It uses cursor effects, audio fade-in and fade-out, and other post-production tools to accurately modify the video material so that you can make better use of the video material. During game recording, unique adaptations and optimizations have been made for various popular games to stabilize the image capture and enhance the game recording experience.","name":"Wondershare DemoCreator","packageUrl":"https://democreator.wondershare.com/","publisher":"Wondershare Software","publisherUrl":"https://www.wondershare.com/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://democreator.wondershare.com/whats-new.html","tags":["ar","capture","class","clip","conference","course","creative","creativity","edit","editor","marketing","meeting","presentation","record","tutorial","video"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/8.8.7/app.json","detailSha256":"c94e10d340306078a9143768a4c06cacfa9be6e3474dae7674b2108fb12765b2","version":"8.8.7"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/8.8.6/app.json","detailSha256":"5bc241aaab724a4eaec00b7b99988fc27da0191da8473117b44bbceb2b90a8e2","version":"8.8.6"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/8.8.5/app.json","detailSha256":"24be30bdacd4aea2232052c4acbde7afda25d9e165b73bc7191a3b086d28a88e","version":"8.8.5"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/8.8.4/app.json","detailSha256":"696fce32747fee33e2c9bd6c4df8b0ae46fed203cb34db4d6f7b893ba6ee0a8c","version":"8.8.4"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/8.8.3/app.json","detailSha256":"fd3a4a495f2b9ea22e991ce2e9a9ba07dd0d4a1c8d03b247c7d113b32fd72d2a","version":"8.8.3"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/8.8.2/app.json","detailSha256":"d4e8b097b87dea4098c7c3f4d0b5bebde7368a5bca0e9c4e7ac1c03e12248130","version":"8.8.2"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/8.8.1/app.json","detailSha256":"1fe323a105498bf8909ce889126eec8f8dad181e198ec4d5e79354c8b99c5dbf","version":"8.8.1"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/8.7.3/app.json","detailSha256":"ad42ced775ca16083d33c7aa296a07e6a87bb22fcf9c356cbb6483e0e70376bf","version":"8.7.